      "key": "quickFacts",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1464",
      "html": "<p>Brochiloricaria macrodon (Kner, 1853), family Loricariidae. Synonym: Loricaria macrodon. Size: 26.8 cm SL. IUCN Red List: Least Concern (last assessed 2018). Type locality: Rio Cuiabá, Brazil.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "distribution",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1464",
      "html": "<p>South America: Paraguay River basin. La Plata, Paraná, Paraguay.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "diet",
      "source": "glaser",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/10-catfishes/brochiloricaria-macrodon/",
      "html": "<p>Brochiloricaria have a completely different mouth structure and feeding habit from Lamontichthys. Like most mouthbrooding whiptail catfish, they are more interested in meaty food than in Aufwuchs.</p>"
    },
    {
      "key": "reproduction",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1464",
      "html": "<p>Breeding: unreported. There is no breeding report.</p>"
